    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/8a3c9a010b6bf72da385727ce0e7a15f.avif?t=1712933423\" /></span><br>It's a 3D third-person platform adventure game.<br> You control a baby who dreams of jumping over obstacles.<br>You have to climb platforms without falling to reach<br>the end.<br>And collect the collectibles along the way<br>A game of jumping up a platform in the fastest possible time<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/1a8cd70d4754e39ef251c703a99a401a.poster.avif?t=1712933423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/1a8cd70d4754e39ef251c703a99a401a.webm?t=1712933423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/1a8cd70d4754e39ef251c703a99a401a.mp4?t=1712933423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's a game where if you fall you have to start all over again, challenging your limits where you have to reach the end in the shortest time possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/c74fb31c6c7574a554bde6b0747af2ea.poster.avif?t=1712933423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/c74fb31c6c7574a554bde6b0747af2ea.webm?t=1712933423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405860/extras/c74fb31c6c7574a554bde6b0747af2ea.mp4?t=1712933423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>climb the platforms and complete the mission without falling and overcoming the obstacles",
